{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115251","id":3198679631,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6-p_pP","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115251","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115251.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115251.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115251","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115251/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115251/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115251/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/bb14fcc810db80effeb848ea682a93895e32aec7","number":115251,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Expose the Geometry2D.segment_intersects_rect method to the scripting API.","user":{"login":"Yanxiyimengya","id":140093497,"node_id":"U_kgDOCFmoOQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/140093497?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yanxiyimengya","html_url":"https://github.com/Yanxiyimengya","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yanxiyimengya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yanxiyimengya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yanxiyimengya/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yanxiyimengya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yanxiyimengya/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yanxiyimengya/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yanxiyimengya/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yanxiyimengya/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yanxiyimengya/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixed #115250\r\n\r\n## Overview\r\nExpose the `Geometry2D.segment_intersects_rect` method to the scripting API, enabling script-level access to line segment vs rectangle intersection detection.\r\n\r\n## Motivation\r\nThe `segment_intersects_rect` method is already implemented in C++ but not accessible to scripting languages (e.g. GDScript/C#). This forces users to reimplement line segment-rectangle intersection logic manually in scripts, leading to code duplication and inconsistent implementations.\r\n\r\n## Implementation Details\r\n### Modified Files\r\n1. `core/core_bind.h` - Add method declaration\r\n2. `core/core_bind.cpp` - Add method wrapper and binding\r\n\r\n### Code Changes\r\n#### 1. core/core_bind.h\r\nAdd the method declaration in the `CoreBind::Geometry2D` class (public section):\r\n```cpp\r\nstatic bool segment_intersects_rect(const Vector2 &p_from, const Vector2 &p_to, const Rect2 &p_rect);\r\n```\r\n\r\n2. core/core_bind.cpp\r\nAdd the method implementation (in Geometry2D method implementation section):\r\n```cpp\r\nbool CoreBind::Geometry2D::segment_intersects_rect(const Vector2 &p_from, const Vector2 &p_to, const Rect2 &p_rect) {  \r\n    return ::Geometry2D::segment_intersects_rect(p_from, p_to, p_rect);  \r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nAdd the method binding in _bind_methods() function:\r\n```cpp\r\nvoid Geometry2D::_bind_methods() {\r\n    //...\r\n    ClassDB::bind_method(D_METHOD(\"segment_intersects_rect\", \"from\", \"to\", \"rect\"), &Geometry2D::segment_intersects_rect);\r\n}\r\n```\r\nTesting\r\nThe underlying ::Geometry2D::segment_intersects_rect method is already tested in C++ core tests\r\nThis PR only adds a scripting API wrapper with no additional logic, so no new test cases are required.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,